{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Verification versus Validation in Thermal Modeling.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Verification versus Validation in Thermal Modeling.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"verification versus validation in thermal modeling verification versus validation in thermal modeling","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Verification versus Validation in Thermal Modeling.md","fileName":"Verification versus Validation in Thermal Modeling.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Verification versus Validation in Thermal Modeling","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-14 00:55\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Thermal Model Verification and Sensitivity]] [[Simulation Geometry Quality]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Thermal Model Verification and Sensitivity","Simulation Geometry Quality","Comparing Thermal Simulation with Infrared Measurements","cosmolheattransfermodels.pdf","geometrycreationandimport.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Verification versus Validation in Thermal Modeling.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Verification versus Validation in Thermal Modeling.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"verification versus validation in thermal modeling verification versus validation in thermal modeling","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Verification versus Validation in Thermal Modeling.md","fileName":"Verification versus Validation in Thermal Modeling.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Verification versus Validation in Thermal Modeling","heading":"Verification versus Validation in Thermal Modeling","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Verification asks whether the mathematical model was implemented and solved correctly. Equation checks, conservation checks, solver convergence, and discretization studies address mistakes or numerical erro